msgstr "페트로자보츠크"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/name_big"
msgid "Petrozavodsk"
msgstr "페트로자보츠크"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/story"
msgid " Continuation war, East Karelia. The next town ahead in this offensive is Petrozavodsk. The Soviets are defending the town, and we must cut their escape route quickly.\n\nGoals:\n - Block the south road.\n - Destroy all enemy forces."
msgstr " 계속 전쟁, 동카렐리야. 이번 공세의 다음 마을은 페트로자보츠크다. 소련군이 마을을 방어하고 있으며 우리는 퇴로를 신속히 차단해야 한다.\n\n목표:\n - 남쪽 도로를 봉쇄하라.\n - 적 병력을 모두 파괴하라."

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/place"
msgid "Petrozavodsk"
msgstr "페트로자보츠크"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/date"
msgid "September, 1941"
msgstr "1941년 9월"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/outro_start"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/outro_completed"
msgid "Mission accomplished!"
msgstr "임무 완수!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/outro_failed"
msgid "Mission failure!"
msgstr "임무 실패!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/outro_failed_hq"
msgid "Mission failed! - Enemy captured your HQ!"
msgstr "임무 실패! - 적이 본부를 점령했다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/mission_hq"
msgid "You must hold your field HQ!"
msgstr "야전 본부를 사수해야 한다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/mission_attack"
msgid "Set up a roadblock on the south escape from Petrozavodsk!"
msgstr "페트로자보츠크 남쪽 탈출로에 저지선을 구축하라!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/flag_capture_status"
msgid "Your soldiers secured %1%/7 Soviet positions!"
msgstr "아군이 소련군 진지 %1%/7곳을 확보했다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/narrator_start0"
msgid "Welcome to East Karelia, Major! This is your new field HQ. It must remain in your control at all cost!"
msgstr "동카렐리아에 온 것을 환영한다, Major! 이곳이 새 야전 본부다. 무슨 일이 있어도 우리 손에 있어야 한다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/narrator_start1"
msgid "You are tasked with cutting the enemy off from escape. After that, you must destroy the defending forces!"
msgstr "임무는 적의 퇴로를 끊는 것이다. 그런 다음 방어 병력을 격멸하라!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/narrator_start2"
msgid "Set up a roadblock and create a \"Motti\" battleground!"
msgstr "저지선을 구축해 \"모티\" 전장을 만들어라!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/narrator_start3"
msgid "Begin securing the objectives, while we bring forward some reinforcements for you to deploy!"
msgstr "목표 확보를 시작해라. 그동안 투입할 증원을 전방으로 보내겠다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/allied_enemy_near_hq"
msgid "Asetoverit! Soviets are threatening our Field HQ!"
msgstr "아세토베리트! 소련군이 우리 야전 본부를 위협하고 있다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/allied_capture_t34"
msgid "Look! There's an abandoned T-34 tank. We may be able to repair it."
msgstr "저기 봐! 버려진 T-34 전차가 있다. 수리해서 쓸 수 있을지도 모른다."

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/player_enemy_near_hq"
msgid "Hold the command post! There can be no talk of retreat here!"
msgstr "지휘소를 사수하라! 이곳에서 후퇴란 있을 수 없다!"

msgctxt "mission/single/03-fin_skirmish/1941_07-fin_petrozavodsk/hq_bonus"
msgid "Major! Now you can request an airstrike."
msgstr "Major! 이제 공습을 요청할 수 있습니다."
